      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/71e660/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-08-07T16:03:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes I saw that – it doesn't contain information that's usually on the back of the spirit board though, which is basically the setup. I might proxy these spirits and give them a try at home if I had all of the info  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>\n<p>I assume you don't want that information to get out, then?</p>",
