      "raw": "<p>Morning everyone!</p><p>I see no reason to hide the setup- you have the cards and the spirit mats.&nbsp; Be aware that these are still being tested, so they might change!</p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Grinning Trickster</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Put 2 presence on your starting board: 1 in the highest-numbered land with&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Dahan, and 1 in land #4.</span></p><p><span><strong>Burning Plague</strong>:&nbsp;</span><span>Put 3 on your starting board: 1 in the Wetland without Dahan, 1 in the&nbsp;</span><span>Mountain without Dahan, and 1 in a land with towns/cities. In that final land, also&nbsp;</span><span>put 1 blight (from the box); this does not destroy or cascade.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>1 of your presence starts the game already destroyed.</span></p>",
